think The row returned as its own threshold teaches: the arc lets go into the spiral, the same fences one turn deeper. Rather than rereading the triad held from an hour before, the lap APPLIED the dual seat -- the three depths of removal -- to the open shred question, and the depth reading produced W5: the 114 almanac stubs serve 107 living witness calls in a choir the cadence roster still sings, so only the append function is consumed and no cut removes it separately; any future cut takes choir plus room as one unit, folded into the %330 design lap. Cut exactly as deep as the truth requires meant no cut today.
